<title>FRANCE: BNP 1996 net attrib jumps 116.1 pct.</title>
<headline>BNP 1996 net attrib jumps 116.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			   3,856  vs	   1,784</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)			5.4  vs	     3.6</p>
<p>    Net provisions			     4,599  vs	   5,533</p>
<p>    Net banking income		    39,112  vs	    37,708</p>
<p>    Operating costs			 28,658  vs	    28,208</p>
<p>    Operating profit			10,545  vs	     9,500</p>
<p>    Pre-tax pre-exceptional		5,855  vs	     3,967</p>
<p>    Exceptionals and other charges	 943  vs		 868</p>
<p>    Taxes					  783  vs	     1,174</p>
<p>    Net					  4,129  vs	     1,925</p>
<p>NOTE - French bank Banque Nationale de Paris gave the results in a statement. It said the 1996 results were restate</p>
</text>
